  "text": "AS PHILP & COME\nSYDNEY\n* LIM TEPH\n9th.\nJune, 1955.\nDear Charles,\nIt was with a great deal of pleasure\nthat we read in this morning's Press that you had had\nconferred upon you by Her Majesty, The Queen, the\ndecoration of Commander of the Order of the British\nEmpire.\nMr. Burns and Mr. Mitchell join me\nin heartily congratulating you on the honour so\nbestowed.\nYours very sincerely,\nHare\nC. H. McFadyen, Esq., C.B.E.,\nSecretary,\nDepartment of Shipping & Transport,\nMELBOURNE,\nVICTORIA.",
